CoreWeave Inference Cookbook patch for slime (https://github.com/THUDM/slime)
Base: commit 0b0c277d5b4cc66efc3b6db269e2e5184e8f3b1e
Purpose: add --update-weight-standalone-publish, so slime runs its disk-delta writer and the
  post-write hook without SGLang engines of its own; nothing changes without the flag.
